---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Septic System Design Pinal County AZ | Diaz Environmental LLC"
  description="ADEQ-certified septic design, percolation testing and permits in Pinal County AZ. Serving Casa Grande, Florence, Coolidge, Eloy & surrounding areas. Call (602) 812-8609."
  canonical="https://diazenviroaz.com/septic-pinal-county"
>
  <main class="service-page">
    <section class="service-hero">
      <h1>Septic System Services in Pinal County, AZ</h1>
      <p>Expert ADEQ-certified septic design and percolation testing throughout Pinal County — from Casa Grande to San Tan Valley and beyond.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn">Get a Free Quote</a>
    </section>
    <section class="service-body">
      <h2>Septic System Design in Pinal County</h2>
      <p>Pinal County is one of the fastest-growing counties in the United States. With large areas of rural and semi-rural land stretching from San Tan Valley in the north to Eloy and Coolidge in the south, a significant portion of Pinal County properties rely on onsite wastewater treatment — septic systems.</p>

      <h2>Cities and Communities We Serve in Pinal County</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>San Tan Valley</li>
        <li>Queen Creek (Pinal County portion)</li>
        <li>Maricopa City</li>
        <li>Casa Grande</li>
        <li>Florence</li>
        <li>Coolidge</li>
        <li>Eloy</li>
        <li>Apache Junction</li>
        <li>Gold Canyon</li>
        <li>Superior</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>ADEQ Septic Permits in Pinal County</h2>
      <p>Pinal County has its own Environmental Health department that works alongside ADEQ for septic system permitting. Our team is fully experienced with Pinal County requirements and can handle the entire process from soil evaluation to permit approval — typically in 3–5 business days.</p>

      <h2>Servicios Sépticos en el Condado de Pinal</h2>
      <p>Ofrecemos diseño de sistemas sépticos certificados por ADEQ, pruebas de percolación y gestión de permisos en todo el Condado de Pinal, incluyendo San Tan Valley, Maricopa, Casa Grande, Florence, Coolidge y más. ¡Hablamos español!</p>
    </section>
    <section class="service-cta">
      <h2>Serving All of Pinal County, AZ</h2>
      <p>Call <a href="tel:6028128609">(602) 812-8609</a> — free consultation, same day response.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn">Contact Us Today</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>
  .service-page { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 2rem; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; }
  .service-hero { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4rem; }
  .service-hero h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #154a2a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-hero p { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .service-body h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #154a2a; margin: 2rem 0 1rem; }
  .service-body p { color: #444; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-body ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .service-body ul li { padding: 0.4rem 0 0.4rem 1.5rem; position: relative; color: #444; }
  .service-body ul li::before { content: "✓"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #154a2a; font-weight: 700; }
  .service-cta { text-align: center; background: #f0f7f2; border-radius: 12px; padding: 3rem 2rem; margin-top: 4rem; }
  .service-cta h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; color: #154a2a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-cta p { color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .service-cta a[href^="tel"] { color: #154a2a; font-weight: 700; }
  .btn { display: inline-block; background: #154a2a; color: white; padding: 13px 30px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; transition: background 0.3s; }
  .btn:hover { background: #0d3019; }
</style>